OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for new SEND primary school
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of a former academy will be
OL,7,Fknocked down to build a new primary
OL,8,Fschool for children with special
OL,9,Feducational needs and disabilities
OL,10,F(SEND).
OL,12,FLincolnshire County Council approved
OL,13,Fproposals to partially demolish the old
OL,14,FEarl of Dysart School, on Dysart Road,
OL,15,Fin Grantham.
OL,17,FThe new primary school will have eight
OL,18,Fclassrooms and capacity to teach up to
OL,19,F96 pupils with moderate and severe
OL,20,Flearning difficulties.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
